  "notes": "{企画|きかく} refers to planning, projects, or proposals, common in business contexts.\n\nUSAGE:\nUsed with する: {企画|きかく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to plan)\nCan refer to both the planning process and the planned project itself.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {企画|きかく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{立|た}てる→立てる：01196_tateru⟧: to make a plan\n- {企画|きかく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{考|かんが}える→考える：00856_kangaeru⟧: to think up a plan\n- {企画|きかく}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{通|とお}る→通る：01243_tooru⟧: a proposal gets approved\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {企画|きかく}⟦{部|ぶ}→〜部：00440_bu⟧: planning department\n- ⟦{企画書|きかくしょ}→企画書：20593_kikakusho⟧: project proposal/plan document\n- ⟦{商品|しょうひん}→商品：01436_shouhin⟧{企画|きかく}: product planning",
